{%- doc -%}
  Eagle & Ash press page (Anu, 4 Nov 2026: doc "Press page – draft – 2026-11-04", "agree on everything").
  Introduction, three gifts with facts (photo, name and price from the product), "Also" line, coming soon, the press kit
  request form (Shopify contact form: the request arrives in the store's email inbox, the link is sent by hand until the
  Klaviyo list "Press" and its automatic email exist), samples and interviews, and plain Amazon links for editors.
  Prices always come from Shopify, so they match the product pages.
{%- enddoc -%}
<div class="section section--page-width">
<div class="ea-press">
  <header class="ea-press__head">
    <h1 class="ea-press__title">{%- render 'ea-accent-text', text: section.settings.heading -%}</h1>
    {%- if section.settings.intro != blank -%}
      <p class="ea-press__intro">{{ section.settings.intro | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </header>

  {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
    <section class="ea-press__part" aria-labelledby="ea-press-gifts">
      {%- if section.settings.gifts_eyebrow != blank -%}<p class="ea-press__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.gifts_eyebrow | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      <h2 class="ea-press__h2" id="ea-press-gifts">{%- render 'ea-accent-text', text: section.settings.gifts_heading -%}</h2>
      <ul class="ea-press__gifts" role="list">
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- if block.type != 'gift' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign p = block.settings.product
            assign p2 = block.settings.product_2
            assign ea_title = block.settings.title | default: p.title
          -%}
          <li class="ea-press__gift" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            {%- if p.featured_image != blank -%}
              <a class="ea-press__photo" href="{{ p.url }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
                {{- p.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '300, 450, 600, 900', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 30vw, 90vw', alt: '' -}}
                {%- if block.settings.label != blank -%}<span class="ea-press__label">{{ block.settings.label | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
              </a>
            {%- endif -%}
            <h3 class="ea-press__gift-title"><a href="{{ p.url }}">{{ ea_title | escape }}</a></h3>
            {%- if p != blank -%}
              <p class="ea-press__price">
                {%- if p2 != blank -%}
                  {{ block.settings.price_label | escape }} {{ p.price | money }} · {{ block.settings.price_label_2 | escape }} {{ p2.price | money }}
                {%- else -%}
                  {{ p.price | money }}
                {%- endif -%}
                <span class="ea-press__price-note"> on Amazon.com</span>
              </p>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if block.settings.line != blank -%}
              <p class="ea-press__line">{{ block.settings.line | escape }}</p>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- comment -%}
              The reason to buy after the one-line angle, in body text (Anu, 6 Nov 2026: the sentences "need a second part
              ... that gives a reason to buy ... so the editors have a whole story in front of them"). Always printed, also
              when empty, so the cards keep sharing the same grid rows.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            <p class="ea-press__why">{{ block.settings.line_2 | escape }}</p>
            {%- assign ea_facts = block.settings.facts | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
            <ul class="ea-press__facts">
              {%- for ea_fact in ea_facts -%}
                {%- assign ea_fact = ea_fact | strip -%}
                {%- if ea_fact != blank -%}<li>{{ ea_fact | escape }}</li>{%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
      {%- assign ea_also = section.settings.also_product -%}
      {%- if ea_also != blank -%}
        {%- comment -%} "from" when the lengths or colours have different prices (tees: 1 1/2" is $13.99, the others $14.99) {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- capture ea_also_price -%}{% if ea_also.price_varies %}from {% endif %}{{ ea_also.price_min | money }}{%- endcapture -%}
        <p class="ea-press__also">
          Also: <a href="{{ ea_also.url }}">{{ ea_also.title | escape }}</a>, {{ ea_also_price }}{% if section.settings.also_text != blank %}, {{ section.settings.also_text | escape }}{% endif %}
        </p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </section>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- liquid
    assign ea_soon_count = 0
    assign ea_launch_count = 0
    for block in section.blocks
      if block.type == 'soon'
        assign ea_soon_count = ea_soon_count | plus: 1
      elsif block.type == 'launch'
        assign ea_launch_count = ea_launch_count | plus: 1
      endif
    endfor
  -%}
  {%- if ea_soon_count > 0 or ea_launch_count > 0 -%}
    <section class="ea-press__part" aria-labelledby="ea-press-soon">
      <h2 class="ea-press__h2 ea-press__h2--tight" id="ea-press-soon">{%- render 'ea-accent-text', text: section.settings.soon_heading -%}</h2>
      {%- if section.settings.soon_text != blank -%}<p class="ea-press__soon-text">{{ section.settings.soon_text | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      <div class="ea-press__soon-grid{% if ea_launch_count > 0 %} ea-press__soon-grid--launch{% endif %}">
      {%- comment -%}
        The gift that launches next, first and framed in orange (Anu, 5 Nov 2026: Mulligan Pills "first place of coming
        soon", "a highlighted sentence ... A mock prescription for real golfers", "a border around it - launching next";
        a fun but useful and stylish gift for Christmas 2026).
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- if block.type != 'launch' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
        <article class="ea-press__launch" aria-labelledby="ea-press-launch-{{ block.id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          {%- if block.settings.image != blank -%}
            <a class="ea-press__launch-photo" href="{{ block.settings.url }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
              {{- block.settings.image | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '300, 450, 600, 900', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 30vw, 90vw', alt: '' -}}
            </a>
          {%- endif -%}
          <div class="ea-press__launch-text">
            {%- if block.settings.label != blank -%}<p class="ea-press__launch-label">{{ block.settings.label | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
            <h3 class="ea-press__gift-title" id="ea-press-launch-{{ block.id }}"><a href="{{ block.settings.url }}">{{ block.settings.name | escape }}</a></h3>
            {%- if block.settings.price != blank -%}
              <p class="ea-press__price">{{ block.settings.price | escape }}<span class="ea-press__price-note"> on Amazon.com</span></p>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if block.settings.hook != blank -%}<p class="ea-press__launch-hook">{{ block.settings.hook | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
            {%- assign ea_facts = block.settings.facts | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
            <ul class="ea-press__facts">
              {%- for ea_fact in ea_facts -%}
                {%- assign ea_fact = ea_fact | strip -%}
                {%- if ea_fact != blank -%}<li>{{ ea_fact | escape }}</li>{%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>
            {%- if block.settings.when != blank -%}<p class="ea-press__launch-when">{{ block.settings.when | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
            <p class="ea-press__launch-links">
              <a href="{{ block.settings.url }}">{{ block.settings.link_label | default: 'See the gift' | escape }}</a>
              {%- if block.settings.sample_link_label != blank -%}<a href="#press-kit">{{ block.settings.sample_link_label | escape }}</a>{%- endif -%}
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
      {%- endfor -%}
      {%- if ea_soon_count > 0 -%}
      <ul class="ea-press__gifts ea-press__gifts--soon" role="list">
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- if block.type != 'soon' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
          <li class="ea-press__gift" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            {%- if block.settings.image != blank -%}
              <a class="ea-press__photo ea-press__photo--soon" href="{{ block.settings.url }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
                {{- block.settings.image | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '300, 450, 600, 900', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 30vw, 90vw', alt: '' -}}
                {%- if block.settings.label != blank -%}<span class="ea-press__label">{{ block.settings.label | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
              </a>
            {%- endif -%}
            <h3 class="ea-press__gift-title"><a href="{{ block.settings.url }}">{{ block.settings.name | escape }}</a></h3>
            {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}<p class="ea-press__soon-line">{{ block.settings.text | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
      {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </section>
  {%- endif -%}

  <section class="ea-press__part ea-press__kit" id="press-kit" aria-labelledby="ea-press-kit">
    <h2 class="ea-press__h2" id="ea-press-kit">{%- render 'ea-accent-text', text: section.settings.kit_heading -%}</h2>
    {%- if section.settings.kit_text != blank -%}<p class="ea-press__kit-text">{{ section.settings.kit_text | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      Two things happen on "Send": (1) the script below adds the email to the Klaviyo list "Press (press page form)"
      (setting klaviyo_list_id), whose flow emails the press kit link; (2) the Shopify contact form sends the whole
      request, with any sample wish and delivery address, to the store's email inbox (the address never goes to
      Klaviyo). After sending, the page shows the press kit link at once, so nobody waits for the email.
      Samples (Anu, 5 Nov 2026): several gifts may be chosen, "subject to availability", and a work email is required
      ("we don't want just deal seekers to get free stuff").
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- form 'contact', id: 'PressKitForm', class: 'ea-press-form', data-klaviyo-company: section.settings.klaviyo_company_id, data-klaviyo-list: section.settings.klaviyo_list_id, data-free-mail-message: section.settings.free_mail_message -%}
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[Form]" value="Press kit request (eagleandash.com/pages/press)">
      {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
        <div class="ea-press-form__ok" role="status" tabindex="-1" autofocus>
          <p>{{ section.settings.success_text | escape }}</p>
          {%- if section.settings.kit_url != blank -%}
            <a class="button ea-press-form__button ea-press-form__kit-link" href="{{ section.settings.kit_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ section.settings.kit_link_label | escape }}</a>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if form.errors -%}
        <p class="ea-press-form__error" role="alert">{{ form.errors.translated_fields.email | capitalize }} {{ form.errors.messages.email }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      <div class="ea-press-form__row">
        <label class="ea-press-form__field">
          <span>Work email</span>
          <input type="email" name="contact[email]" required autocomplete="email" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="off">
        </label>
        <label class="ea-press-form__field">
          <span>Publication or website</span>
          <input type="text" name="contact[Publication or website]" required autocomplete="organization">
        </label>
      </div>
      <label class="ea-press-form__check">
        <input type="checkbox" name="contact[Sample wanted]" value="Yes" data-press-sample>
        <span>{{ section.settings.sample_label | escape }}</span>
      </label>
      <div class="ea-press-form__sample">
        <p class="ea-press-form__sample-note">{{ section.settings.sample_note | escape }}</p>
        <fieldset class="ea-press-form__gifts">
          {%- comment -%} "products", not "gifts": it must not sound as if we give the editor a present (Anu, 6 Nov 2026) {%- endcomment -%}
          <legend>Which products? Choose one or more.</legend>
          {%- for p in section.settings.sample_products -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign ea_name = p.title
              if p.metafields.custom.style_swatch.value != blank and p.metafields.custom.other_styles.value.size > 1
                assign ea_name = section.settings.links_family_name | default: p.title
              endif
              if p.metafields.custom.coming_soon.value != blank or p.available == false
                assign ea_name = ea_name | append: ' (after the launch)'
              endif
            -%}
            <label class="ea-press-form__check ea-press-form__check--gift">
              <input type="checkbox" name="contact[Sample: {{ ea_name | escape }}]" value="Yes" data-press-gift="{{ ea_name | escape }}">
              <span>{{ ea_name | escape }}</span>
            </label>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </fieldset>
        <label class="ea-press-form__field">
          <span>Colour, scent or length you would like (optional)</span>
          <input type="text" name="contact[Colour, scent or length]">
        </label>
        <label class="ea-press-form__field">
          <span>Link to one of your recent articles</span>
          <input type="url" name="contact[Recent article]" inputmode="url" placeholder="https://">
        </label>
        <label class="ea-press-form__field">
          <span>Your name</span>
          <input type="text" name="contact[name]" autocomplete="name" data-press-sample-required>
        </label>
        <label class="ea-press-form__field">
          <span>Delivery address</span>
          <textarea name="contact[Delivery address]" rows="3" autocomplete="street-address" data-press-sample-required></textarea>
        </label>
      </div>
      <p class="ea-press-form__error" role="alert" data-press-error hidden></p>
      <button type="submit" class="button ea-press-form__button">{{ section.settings.button_label | escape }}</button>
      {%- if section.settings.privacy != blank -%}<div class="ea-press-form__privacy">{{ section.settings.privacy }}</div>{%- endif -%}
    {%- endform -%}

    {%- if section.settings.credit != blank -%}<p class="ea-press__credit">{{ section.settings.credit | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
  </section>

  {%- if section.settings.samples_text != blank -%}
    <section class="ea-press__part" aria-labelledby="ea-press-samples">
      <h2 class="ea-press__h2" id="ea-press-samples">{%- render 'ea-accent-text', text: section.settings.samples_heading -%}</h2>
      <div class="ea-press__rte">{{ section.settings.samples_text }}</div>
    </section>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if section.settings.link_products != blank -%}
    <section class="ea-press__part" aria-labelledby="ea-press-links">
      <h2 class="ea-press__h2" id="ea-press-links">{%- render 'ea-accent-text', text: section.settings.links_heading -%}</h2>
      {%- if section.settings.links_text != blank -%}<p>{{ section.settings.links_text | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      <ul class="ea-press__links" role="list">
        {%- assign ea_families_done = '' -%}
        {%- for p in section.settings.link_products -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign ea_family = p.metafields.custom.other_styles.value | map: 'handle'
            assign ea_family_key = ea_family | join: ','
          -%}
          {%- comment -%}
            Sister scent pages (custom.style_swatch + custom.other_styles, the bath bombs) share one row: the name once and
            one link, with all scents in brackets. On Amazon the scents are one listing with a scent choice, so one link
            opens all of them (Anu, 4 Nov 2026: "no need to replicate bath bombs", "keep only Sandalwood").
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- if p.metafields.custom.style_swatch.value != blank and ea_family.size > 1 -%}
            {%- if ea_families_done contains ea_family_key -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign ea_families_done = ea_families_done | append: '|' | append: ea_family_key
              assign ea_link_product = p
              if section.settings.links_family_product != blank and ea_family contains section.settings.links_family_product.handle
                assign ea_link_product = section.settings.links_family_product
              endif
              assign ea_url = ea_link_product.selected_or_first_available_variant.metafields.custom.amazon_url.value | split: '?' | first
              assign ea_names = ''
              for item in p.metafields.custom.other_styles.value
                assign ea_name = item.title
                if item.title contains '–'
                  assign ea_name = item.title | split: '–' | last
                endif
                assign ea_name = ea_name | split: '(' | first | strip
                unless forloop.first
                  if forloop.last
                    assign ea_names = ea_names | append: ' and '
                  else
                    assign ea_names = ea_names | append: ', '
                  endif
                endunless
                assign ea_names = ea_names | append: ea_name
              endfor
            -%}
            {%- if ea_url != blank -%}
              <li>
                <span class="ea-press__link-name">{{ section.settings.links_family_name | default: p.title | escape }}</span>
                <span><a href="{{ ea_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ ea_url | remove: 'https://' | remove: 'www.' }}</a> ({{ ea_names | escape }})</span>
              </li>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- continue -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- comment -%} The plain Amazon address (no Attribution code): editors add their own Associates link. {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- assign ea_url = p.selected_or_first_available_variant.metafields.custom.amazon_url.value | split: '?' | first -%}
          {%- comment -%}
            Variations in brackets as plain text, as in the bath bomb row (Anu, 5 Nov 2026: "list variations in brackets
            for all the products"; 6 Nov 2026: "listed behind the links as regular list, just as for the bath bombs").
            One link per product: on Amazon every colour or length opens from it. A colour without its own Amazon
            address yet (Pink) is named after the others with the text of setting links_soon_suffix (Anu, 6 Nov 2026:
            "the pink pouches don't need a separate link, they will be reachable from the same parent link").
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign ea_on = ''
            assign ea_soon = ''
            unless p.has_only_default_variant
              for v in p.variants
                if v.metafields.custom.amazon_url.value != blank
                  assign ea_on = ea_on | append: v.title | append: '|'
                else
                  assign ea_soon = ea_soon | append: v.title | append: '|'
                endif
              endfor
            endunless
            assign ea_on = ea_on | split: '|'
            assign ea_soon = ea_soon | split: '|'
            assign ea_variations = ''
            for ea_v in ea_on
              unless forloop.first
                if forloop.last
                  assign ea_variations = ea_variations | append: ' and '
                else
                  assign ea_variations = ea_variations | append: ', '
                endif
              endunless
              assign ea_variations = ea_variations | append: ea_v
            endfor
            if ea_soon.size > 0
              assign ea_soon_names = ea_soon | join: ' and '
              assign ea_variations = ea_variations | append: '; ' | append: ea_soon_names | append: ' ' | append: section.settings.links_soon_suffix | strip
            endif
          -%}
          {%- if ea_url != blank -%}
            <li>
              <span class="ea-press__link-name">{{ p.title | escape }}</span>
              <span><a href="{{ ea_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ ea_url | remove: 'https://' | remove: 'www.' }}</a>{% if ea_variations != blank %} ({{ ea_variations | escape }}){% endif %}</span>
            </li>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          Gifts that are not on sale yet: their Amazon address from the "Launching next" card, with a note such as the
          expected date (Anu, 6 Nov 2026: Mulligan Pills "let's already add a link - it will start to show the product
          next week"). The product's own "Shop on Amazon" button stays "Coming soon" until its Amazon link is set.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- if block.type != 'launch' or block.settings.amazon_url == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- assign ea_url = block.settings.amazon_url | split: '?' | first -%}
          <li>
            <span class="ea-press__link-name">{{ block.settings.links_name | default: block.settings.name | escape }}</span>
            <span><a href="{{ ea_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ ea_url | remove: 'https://' | remove: 'www.' }}</a>{% if block.settings.links_note != blank %} ({{ block.settings.links_note | escape }}){% endif %}</span>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </section>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  .ea-press {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 56px;
    padding-block: 48px 72px;
    color: #001e26;
  }

  .ea-press__head {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  /* page title: 24 px on phones, 32 px on computers, Lora 400, as every page title (design rules, 5 Nov 2026) */
  .ea-press__title {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ea-press__intro,
  .ea-press__kit-text {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* small label above the gifts heading, as above the FAQ (Anu, 4 Nov 2026: "Featured" above the three cards) */
  .ea-press__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #115e67;
  }

  /* the site's heading scale (3 Nov 2026): 30 px computers, 24 px phones; card titles 22 / 19 px */
  .ea-press__h2 {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ea-press .ea-accent {
    color: #fd5000;
  }

  .ea-press__gifts {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .ea-press__gift {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ea-press__photo {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    margin-block-end: 8px;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #fff;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px #e3e7e7;
  }

  .ea-press__photo img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    transform: scale(0.9);
  }

  /* the gift's role in the game, top left on the photo (Anu, 4 Nov 2026: Play, Honor, Unwind) */
  .ea-press__label {
    position: absolute;
    inset-block-start: 12px;
    inset-inline-start: 12px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #001e26;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  /* coming-soon photos are full scenes on the Shop tiles' light background: fill the frame */
  .ea-press__photo--soon img {
    object-fit: cover;
    transform: none;
  }

  .ea-press__h2--tight {
    margin-block-end: 8px;
  }

  .ea-press__soon-text {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  .ea-press__soon-line {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ea-press__gift-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ea-press__gift-title a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .ea-press__gift-title a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .ea-press__price {
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ea-press__price-note {
    font-weight: 400;
    color: rgb(0 30 38 / 0.7);
  }

  .ea-press__line {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-heading--family);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* the reason to buy: running text, so Roboto (design rules: Lora for headings only) */
  .ea-press__why {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ea-press__facts,
  .ea-press__list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    margin: 4px 0 0;
    padding-inline-start: 20px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ea-press__also {
    margin: 28px 0 0;
  }

  .ea-press a {
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .ea-press__also a,
  .ea-press__rte a,
  .ea-press__links a,
  .ea-press-form__privacy a {
    color: #b83a00;
  }

  /* the orange heading word on the blue band: #e04800 (3.3:1, large text), as on "Complete the set" */
  .ea-press__kit .ea-accent {
    color: #e04800;
  }

  /* the press kit band: the light blue of "Complete the set" */
  .ea-press__kit {
    padding: 32px 20px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--soaring-brand-blue, #d5ebee);
  }

  .ea-press-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-block-start: 20px;
  }

  .ea-press-form__row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .ea-press-form__field {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .ea-press-form__field input,
  .ea-press-form__field textarea,
  .ea-press-form__field select {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border: 1px solid #001e26;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: #fff;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #001e26;
  }

  .ea-press-form__check {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 15px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .ea-press-form__check input {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    margin: 1px 0 0;
    accent-color: #001e26;
    flex: none;
  }

  /* the name and delivery address appear only when the sample box is ticked */
  .ea-press-form__sample {
    display: none;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .ea-press-form:has(.ea-press-form__check input:checked) .ea-press-form__sample {
    display: grid;
  }

  .ea-press-form__sample-note {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  /* the site's button: Roboto capitals, bold, 19 px, 0.12em, white on #fd5000 (design rules) */
  .ea-press-form__button {
    align-self: flex-start;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding-inline: 28px;
    font-family: var(--font-body--family);
    font-size: 1.1875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    --button-color: #fff;
    --button-background-color: #fd5000;
    --button-border-color: #fd5000;
  }

  .ea-press-form__button:hover {
    --button-background-color: #b83a00;
    --button-border-color: #b83a00;
  }

  .ea-press-form__privacy,
  .ea-press__credit {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .ea-press-form__privacy p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ea-press-form__ok {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: #fff;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ea-press-form__error {
    margin: 0;
    color: #a3000b;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ea-press__credit {
    margin-block-start: 16px;
  }

  .ea-press__rte p {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .ea-press__links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .ea-press__links li {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    column-gap: 12px;
  }

  .ea-press__link-name {
    min-width: 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ea-press__links a {
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  /* coming-soon cards smaller than the featured three (Anu, 4 Nov 2026): two per row on phones */
  .ea-press__gifts--soon {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .ea-press__gifts--soon .ea-press__gift-title {
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  .ea-press__gifts--soon .ea-press__soon-line {
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  /* "Launching next": the next gift, framed in brand orange, first in Coming soon (Anu, 5 Nov 2026) */
  .ea-press__soon-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .ea-press__launch {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 20px;
    border: 2px solid #fd5000;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #fff;
  }

  .ea-press__launch-photo {
    display: block;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .ea-press__launch-photo img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ea-press__launch-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  /* white on #b83a00: 5.0:1, readable at 12 px (white on #fd5000 only for bold 19 px and up) */
  .ea-press__launch-label {
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #b83a00;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .ea-press__launch-hook {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-heading--family);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: #115e67;
  }

  .ea-press__launch-when {
    margin: 4px 0 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ea-press__launch-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px 24px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ea-press__launch-links a {
    color: #b83a00;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ea-press__links span a {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .ea-press-form__gifts {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
  }

  .ea-press-form__gifts legend {
    margin-block-end: 10px;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .ea-press-form__ok p {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .ea-press-form__kit-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ea-press__launch {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 3fr);
      gap: 28px;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .ea-press-form__gifts {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      column-gap: 24px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
    /* the launch card wide, the other coming-soon gifts in a narrow column next to it */
    .ea-press__soon-grid--launch {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 3fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      align-items: start;
    }

    .ea-press__soon-grid--launch .ea-press__gifts--soon {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .ea-press__soon-grid--launch .ea-press__gifts--soon .ea-press__gift {
      display: flex;
      grid-row: auto;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ea-press-form__row {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .ea-press__kit {
      padding: 40px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
    .ea-press {
      gap: 72px;
      padding-block: 64px 96px;
    }

    .ea-press__title {
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    .ea-press__h2 {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .ea-press__gifts {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 40px;
    }

    /* every card's name, price, sentence and first fact start on the same line as in the other cards
       (Anu, 4 Nov 2026): the cards share the rows of the grid */
    .ea-press__gift {
      display: grid;
      grid-row: span 6;
      grid-template-rows: subgrid;
      row-gap: 8px;
    }

    .ea-press__gifts--soon .ea-press__gift {
      grid-row: span 3;
    }

    .ea-press__gift-title {
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    /* the names in one column, each on one line (Anu, 4 Nov 2026: "sleek") */
    .ea-press__links {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: max-content minmax(0, 1fr);
      column-gap: 32px;
      row-gap: 8px;
    }

    .ea-press__links li {
      display: contents;
    }

    .ea-press__link-name {
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    /* four per row on computers: each photo about a quarter narrower than a featured one */
    .ea-press__gifts--soon {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .ea-press__gifts--soon .ea-press__gift-title {
      font-size: 19px;
    }
  }
  /* section titles 30 px from 1200 px (28 px from 990 px, 24 px below): the site's heading scale */
  @media screen and (min-width: 1200px) {
    .ea-press__h2 {
      font-size: 30px;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% javascript %}
  (() => {
    // Eagle & Ash press form (5 Nov 2026). On "Send": check the sample part, add the email to the Klaviyo list
    // "Press (press page form)" (its flow emails the press kit link), then send the Shopify contact form as usual.
    // The delivery address goes only to the store inbox (Shopify), never to Klaviyo.
    const FREE_MAIL = /@(gmail|googlemail|yahoo|ymail|rocketmail|hotmail|outlook|live|msn|aol|icloud|me|mac|proton|protonmail|pm|gmx|mail|yandex|comcast|att|verizon|sbcglobal|bellsouth|cox|charter|earthlink|juno|optonline)\.[a-z.]+$/i;

    const setUp = (form) => {
      if (!form || form.dataset.pressReady) return;
      form.dataset.pressReady = '1';
      const sample = form.querySelector('[data-press-sample]');
      const errorBox = form.querySelector('[data-press-error]');
      const requiredWithSample = form.querySelectorAll('[data-press-sample-required]');
      const showError = (text) => {
        errorBox.textContent = text;
        errorBox.hidden = false;
        errorBox.scrollIntoView({ block: 'center', behavior: 'smooth' });
      };
      const syncRequired = () => requiredWithSample.forEach((el) => { el.required = sample.checked; });
      sample?.addEventListener('change', syncRequired);
      syncRequired();

      form.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
        if (form.dataset.pressSending === 'done') return; // second, real submit
        event.preventDefault();
        errorBox.hidden = true;
        const email = (form.querySelector('[name="contact[email]"]')?.value || '').trim();
        const publication = (form.querySelector('[name="contact[Publication or website]"]')?.value || '').trim();
        const gifts = [...form.querySelectorAll('[data-press-gift]:checked')].map((el) => el.dataset.pressGift);
        if (sample?.checked) {
          if (gifts.length === 0) { showError('Please choose at least one gift for your sample.'); return; }
          if (FREE_MAIL.test(email)) {
            showError(form.dataset.freeMailMessage || 'For samples, please use your work email address.');
            return;
          }
        }
        const button = form.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');
        if (button) button.disabled = true;
        const company = form.dataset.klaviyoCompany;
        const list = form.dataset.klaviyoList;
        if (company && list && email) {
          const controller = new AbortController();
          const timer = setTimeout(() => controller.abort(), 5000);
          try {
            await fetch(`https://a.klaviyo.com/client/subscriptions/?company_id=${encodeURIComponent(company)}`, {
              method: 'POST',
              signal: controller.signal,
              headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/vnd.api+json', Accept: 'application/vnd.api+json', revision: '2025-07-15' },
              body: JSON.stringify({ data: { type: 'subscription', attributes: {
                custom_source: 'Press page: press kit',
                profile: { data: { type: 'profile', attributes: {
                  email,
                  properties: {
                    'Press publication': publication,
                    'Press sample requested': sample?.checked ? 'Yes' : 'No',
                    'Press sample gifts': sample?.checked ? gifts.join(', ') : '',
                  },
                  subscriptions: { email: { marketing: { consent: 'SUBSCRIBED' } } },
                } } },
              }, relationships: { list: { data: { type: 'list', id: list } } } } }),
            });
          } catch (e) {
            // Klaviyo not reachable: the Shopify form still sends the request, and the page shows the link.
          } finally {
            clearTimeout(timer);
          }
        }
        form.dataset.pressSending = 'done';
        // requestSubmit runs Shopify's own submit listeners (spam protection) too; this handler then lets it pass
        if (typeof form.requestSubmit === 'function') form.requestSubmit();
        else HTMLFormElement.prototype.submit.call(form);
      });
    };

    const init = () => document.querySelectorAll('form#PressKitForm').forEach(setUp);
    init();
    document.addEventListener('shopify:section:load', init);
  })();
{% endjavascript %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Press page",
  "class": "section-wrapper",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "info": "Words between two stars are orange.", "default": "Press" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "intro", "label": "Introduction" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "gifts_eyebrow", "label": "Gifts: small label above the heading", "default": "Featured gifts" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "gifts_heading", "label": "Gifts: heading", "default": "Three gifts for your *gift guide.*" },
    { "type": "product", "id": "also_product", "label": "\"Also:\" product" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "also_text", "label": "\"Also:\" text after the price" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "soon_heading", "label": "Coming soon: heading", "default": "Coming *soon.*" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "soon_text", "label": "Coming soon: sentence under the heading", "info": "The gifts themselves are \"Coming soon\" blocks." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "kit_heading", "label": "Press kit: heading", "default": "Press *kit.*" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "kit_text", "label": "Press kit: text" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "sample_label", "label": "Sample tick box", "default": "I'd also like a product sample for a review or gift guide" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "sample_note", "label": "Sample: note above the sample fields" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "button_label", "label": "Button", "default": "Send me the press kit" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "success_text", "label": "Message after sending", "default": "Thank you! We'll email you the link to the press kit." },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "privacy", "label": "Line under the form" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "credit", "label": "Photo credit", "info": "Empty until the photographer has answered." },
    { "type": "url", "id": "kit_url", "label": "Press kit: link shown after sending", "info": "The Google Drive folder with the press photos." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "kit_link_label", "label": "Press kit: link button", "default": "Open the press photos" },
    { "type": "product_list", "id": "sample_products", "label": "Sample: gifts to choose from", "limit": 10 },
    { "type": "text", "id": "free_mail_message", "label": "Sample: message for a private email address" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "klaviyo_company_id", "label": "Klaviyo company ID", "default": "RMHHKa" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "klaviyo_list_id", "label": "Klaviyo list ID (press list)", "info": "The list \"Press (press page form)\". Its flow emails the press kit link." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "samples_heading", "label": "Samples: heading", "default": "Samples and *interviews.*" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "samples_text", "label": "Samples: text" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "links_heading", "label": "Links: heading", "default": "Linking to our *gifts.*" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "links_text", "label": "Links: text" },
    { "type": "product_list", "id": "link_products", "label": "Links: products", "limit": 12, "info": "Each shows its plain Amazon address (from the first colour's Amazon link, without the tracking code)." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "links_family_name", "label": "Links: name of the scents row", "default": "Golf Ball Bath Bombs (4 Pack)", "info": "Sister scent pages share one row: this name, one Amazon link, all scents in brackets." },
    { "type": "product", "id": "links_family_product", "label": "Links: scent whose Amazon link the row uses", "info": "On Amazon the scents are one listing with a scent choice, so one link opens all of them. Empty: the first scent in the list." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "links_soon_suffix", "label": "Links: text after a colour that is not on Amazon yet", "default": "from November 2026", "info": "Such a colour (no Amazon link on its variant) is named after the others, e.g. \"; Pink from November 2026\"." }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "gift",
      "name": "Gift",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "product", "id": "product", "label": "Product (photo, link, price)" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "label", "label": "Label on the photo (e.g. Play)" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Name shown", "info": "Empty = the product's name." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "price_label", "label": "Price label (when there are two products)" },
        { "type": "product", "id": "product_2", "label": "Second product (optional, its price only)" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "price_label_2", "label": "Second price label" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "line", "label": "One-line angle" },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "line_2", "label": "Reason to buy (after the angle)" },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "facts", "label": "Facts: one per line" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "launch",
      "name": "Launching next",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Photo" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "label", "label": "Label", "default": "Launching next" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "name", "label": "Name" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "price", "label": "Amazon price (e.g. $12.99)", "info": "Written by hand until the product is on sale: change it when the Amazon price changes." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "hook", "label": "Highlighted sentence" },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "facts", "label": "Facts: one per line" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "when", "label": "When (bold line)" },
        { "type": "url", "id": "url", "label": "Link (the product's page)" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "link_label", "label": "Link text", "default": "See the gift" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "sample_link_label", "label": "Link to the sample form (optional)" },
        { "type": "url", "id": "amazon_url", "label": "Amazon address for the links list (optional)", "info": "Shown in \"Linking to our gifts\" before the product is on sale." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "links_name", "label": "Name in the links list", "info": "Empty = the name above." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "links_note", "label": "Note in brackets in the links list", "info": "For example the expected date." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "soon",
      "name": "Coming soon",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Photo" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "name", "label": "Name" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "label", "label": "Label on the photo (optional)" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "text", "label": "Line under the name" },
        { "type": "url", "id": "url", "label": "Link (the product's page, where people can sign up)" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Press page" }]
}
